or every project. This optimizes scarce resources.\n\n    *   The proposal ensures that the technical capability for logging is present *from day one*.\n    *   It specifically targets the high-risk requirements of Article 12(3).\n    *   It reduces the \"friction\" for engineers, meaning they are less likely to bypass compliance measures in favor of speed.\n\n    *   Rationale: This proposal implements \"compliance by design\" by automating the mandatory record-keeping requirements of Article 12, significantly reducing the risk of regulatory gaps caused by developer oversight while maintaining R&D velocity.\n    *   Decision: approve.\n    *   Promise: 95 (Very high because it addresses a legal mandate with a scalable technical solution).",
