nism rather than relying on project-by-project whims.\n    *   It solves the problem of data loss at funding boundaries (a common R&D failure mode).\n    *   The API for Compliance Officers is a high-value feature for audit readiness.\n\n    *   Rationale: This proposal directly addresses the mandatory \"lifetime\" logging requirement of Article 12(1) and mitigates the significant regulatory risk associated with project-based data deletion. Centralizing this infrastructure ensures institutional consistency, simplifies audits, and prevents productivity loss for R&D staff.\n    *   Decision: approve.\n    *   Promise: 95 (It's a foundational requirement; without it, compliance is impossible across the portfolio).",
