ive integration is the correct technical approach to ensure reliability and speed.\n\n    *   Rationale: Integrating logging into the CI/CD pipeline prevents compliance debt and improves experimental reproducibility without hindering prototype speed. This \"shift-left\" approach ensures that required data points are captured systematically rather than manually retrofitted during deployment.\n    *   Decision: approve.\n    *   Promise: 95 (Highly standard engineering practice, low risk, high reward for both compliance and quality).",
