ory nightmare.\n\n    *   Does it meet Article 12(1)? Yes (automatic recording).\n    *   Does it meet Article 12(3) for specific systems? Yes (explicitly lists the required data points).\n    *   Does it support Article 12(2) generally? Yes, by providing a platform that can be extended to capture events relevant to risk identification and post-market monitoring.\n\n    *   *Rationale:* Centralizing logging ensures consistent compliance across all high-risk systems and eliminates the risk of fragmented or missing records, while specifically addressing the mandatory requirements for Annex III 1(a) systems through an auditable, append-only architecture.\n    *   *Decision:* Approve.\n    *   *Promise:* High (90+). It's a pragmatic, systemic solution to a regulatory mandate.\n\n    *   Rationale: 1-2 sentences? Yes.\n    *   Decision: \"approve\" or \"reject\"? Yes.\n    *   Promise: Integer 0-100? Yes.\n    *   ID echoed exactly? P1548.",
