nerating scientific asset.\n    *   Decision: Approve.\n    *   Promise: High (around 85). It's a very pragmatic way to handle the EU AI Act without slowing down individual research pipelines too much.\n\n    *   Rationale check: Did I mention resource allocation? Yes. Scientific ambition? Yes. Infrastructure? Yes.\n    *   Decision check: Approve/Reject.\n    *   Promise check: 0-100 integer.",
